            "count": 0,
            "text": "Created attachment 3601\nCandidate patch.\n\nThese can usually be triggered using `grepRaw()` with invalid or incomplete patterns with R build with ASAN. For example:\n\n```\n> grepRaw(\"(\", \"abc\")\n=================================================================\n==1871632==ERROR: AddressSanitizer: heap-buffer-overflow on address 0x7b30fd9f99b4 at pc 0x7f1102f9db0e bp 0x7fffca3dab30 sp 0x7fffca3dab28\nREAD of size 4 at 0x7b30fd9f99b4 thread T0\n    #0 0x7f1102f9db0d in tre_parse /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/extra/tre/tre-parse.c:1227\n    #1 0x7f1102f738d7 in tre_compile /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/extra/tre/tre-compile.c:1920\n    #2 0x7f1102f60680 in tre_regncompb /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/extra/tre/regcomp.c:118\n    #3 0x7f1102b04e3f in do_grepraw /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/grep.c:1736\n    #4 0x7f1102a1a483 in bcEval_loop /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/eval.c:8132\n    #5 0x7f1102a6d064 in bcEval /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/eval.c:7515\n    #6 0x7f1102a6db85 in Rf_eval /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/eval.c:1167\n    #7 0x7f1102a7b90b in R_execClosure /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/eval.c:2389\n    #8 0x7f1102a7bc84 in applyClosure_core /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/eval.c:2302\n    #9 0x7f1102a7f46c in Rf_applyClosure /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/eval.c:2324\n    #10 0x7f1102a6fafd in Rf_eval /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/eval.c:1280\n    #11 0x7f1102b61c45 in Rf_ReplIteration /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/main.c:264\n    #12 0x7f1102b621f3 in R_ReplConsole /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/main.c:317\n    #13 0x7f1102b6237f in run_Rmainloop /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/main.c:1235\n    #14 0x7f1102b623cc in Rf_mainloop /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/main.c:1242\n    #15 0x0000004004f3 in main /home/kevin/r-devel/trunk/src/main/Rmain.c:29\n    #16 0x7f11018105b4 in __libc_start_call_main (/lib64/libc.so.6+0x35b4) (BuildId: 57f6900d44d37352280570abdffc4f01a1803226)\n    #17 0x7f1101810667 in __libc_start_main@@GLIBC_2.34 (/lib64/libc.so.6+0x3667) (BuildId: 57f6900d44d37352280570abdffc4f01a1803226)\n    #18 0x0000004003e4 in _start (/home/kevin/r/r-devel-sanitizers/lib64/R/bin/exec/R+0x4003e4) (BuildId: a96b5b8788e93e4b9d0462028242bff17a2aceb1)\n```\n\nI've attached a patch for some of the specific access issues I've found.\n\n```\n> sessionInfo()\nR Under development (unstable) (2026-01-25 r89330)\nPlatform: x86_64-pc-linux-gnu\nRunning under: Fedora Linux 43 (Workstation Edition)\n```",
            "bug_id": 18995,
            "attachment_id": 3601,
            "time": "2026-01-26T17:32:18Z",
