            "id": 104015,
            "is_private": false,
            "creation_time": "2026-10-30T01:32:10Z",
            "text": "Created attachment 3975\npatch: bound tre_parse() reads to the end of the pattern (clean copy of 3601, with test)\n\nAttachment 3601 was pasted into the web form, which mangled its whitespace, so it only applies with patch -l. Attached is the same change as a proper SVN diff against r90794 (tre-parse.c is unchanged since r89330), plus a regression test.\n\nTo check it I ran every prefix of a set of bracket, brace, (?...) and escape patterns through grepRaw() on an ASan build: 14 of 91 read past the end of the pattern before the patch, in tre_parse_bracket(), tre_parse_bracket_items() and tre_parse(), and none after. make check passes.\n\nPatch also at https://github.com/r-devel/r-svn/pull/439, where CI results can be seen.",
            "bug_id": 18995,
            "count": 1
          }
